Description: ARCO authors tools, styles and templates
 LaTeX and DocBook utilities and styles for Arco authors.
 .
 This package provides:
  * LaTeX classes and styles for articles, reports, books and exams.
  * Makefile rules (installed in /usr/include/arco) to build LaTeX and
    DocBook documents and to convert figures from SVG, Dia, Graphviz and
    LibreOffice formats.
  * Command line tools to build figures, arrange PDF pages for printing
    and edit PDF metadata.
  * Logos and watermarks used by the document templates.
  * The Bera and Inconsolata fonts for LaTeX.
